          <items xsi:type="form:FormField">
            <name>RecordCostDecreaseByReversal</name>
            <id>105</id>
            <title>
              <key>en</key>
              <value>Decrease is recorded by reversing expenses</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>fa</key>
              <value>کاهش با برگشت هزینه‌ها ثبت می‌شود</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>ru</key>
              <value>Уменьшение отражается путем сторнирования расходов</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>tr</key>
              <value>Düşüş giderlerin tersine çevrilmesiyle yansıtılır</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>vi</key>
              <value>Thao tác ghi giảm được phản ánh bằng cách đảo ngược chi phí</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>it</key>
              <value>Decrease is recorded by reversing expenses</value>
            </title>
            <title>
