            <enabled>true</enabled>
            <userVisible>
              <common>true</common>
            </userVisible>
            <dataPath xsi:type="form:DataPath">
              <segments>RecordCostDecreaseByReversal</segments>
            </dataPath>
            <titleLocation>Right</titleLocation>
            <toolTipRepresentation>Button</toolTipRepresentation>
            <handlers>
              <event>OnChange</event>
              <name>RecordCostDecreaseByReversalOnChange</name>
            </handlers>
            <extendedTooltip>
              <name>RecordCostDecreaseByReversalExtendedTooltip</name>
              <id>107</id>
              <title>
                <key>en</key>
                <value>For example, it can be used to reduce cost if the document related to fixed asset purchase was reversed.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>fa</key>
                <value>برای مثال، می‌تواند برای کاهش بهای تمام‌شده در صورتی استفاده شود که سند مرتبط با خرید دارایی ثابت برگشت داده شده باشد.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>ru</key>
                <value>Например, может использоваться для уменьшения стоимости, если был сторнирован документ, связанный с приобретением основного средства.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>tr</key>
                <value>Örneğin, bir sabit kıymetin edinimi ile ilgili bir belgenin iptal edilmesi durumunda maliyetin düşürülmesi için kullanılabilir.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>vi</key>
                <value>Ví dụ: có thể sử dụng để giảm giá trị, nếu đảo ngược chứng từ liên quan đến mua sắm tài sản cố định.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>it</key>
                <value>For example, it can be used to reduce cost if the document related to fixed asset purchase was reversed.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>pl</key>
                <value>For example, it can be used to reduce cost if the document related to fixed asset purchase was reversed.</value>
              </title>
              <type>Label</type>
              <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
              <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
              <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
                <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
              </extInfo>
            </extendedTooltip>
